      "id": "selection-rule",
      "variable": "AOCC01FL",
      "title": "Define-XML selects the wrong event group",
      "summary": "The blank-query condition selects events outside the dermatologic group, conflicting with the guide and the reference flags. The implementation already selects dermatologic events.",
      "expected": "Select CQ01NAM='DERMATOLOGIC EVENTS' and TRTEMFL='Y', then flag the first event by ASTDT and AESEQ within each subject.",
      "observed": "Define-XML says CQ01NAM='', which excludes the populated dermatologic query. Applying that condition flags different records from the reference.",
      "action": "Correct the AOCC01FL condition in Define-XML to CQ01NAM='DERMATOLOGIC EVENTS'. Keep TRTEMFL='Y' and the documented ASTDT, AESEQ order. The guide interpretation reproduces all reference flags.",
      "checks": [
        "ADAE.AOCC01FL.CR-8.4",
