      "id": "sorting-rule",
      "variable": "AOCC01FL",
      "title": "Sequence-only ordering omits the documented start-date priority",
      "summary": "The documented rule orders eligible dermatologic events by ASTDT, then AESEQ. DERM_RN uses AESEQ alone. The chronological interpretation matches both the reference and yamaa flags on this dataset.",
      "expected": "Within each subject, select the earliest treatment-emergent dermatologic event by ASTDT; use AESEQ to break ties.",
      "observed": "DERM_RN orders by AESEQ alone. No difference from the chronological interpretation was observed in the tested flags.",
      "action": "Add ASTDT before AESEQ in DERM_RN. Keep the dermatologic-event filter. This states the documented chronology; the tested data does not demonstrate an ordering failure.",
